{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>For the tribe of Joseph, for the tribe of Manasseh.</b> Here Joseph demoted him from his prominence, because he brought out an evil report, and therefore he is mentioned here under the tribe of Manasseh, for he was among those who brought out the evil report, and not under the tribe of Ephraim, who did not bring it out. And in all other places he is mentioned under the tribe of Ephraim."], :book :numbers, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:09:23.569090606Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}